# =====================================================================
# .gitignore — Voluta (pure .NET library, no frontend)
# =====================================================================
# Base from anlytra/plexor/tessera convention. Adapted: dropped FE bits,
# dropped Docker/deploy bits, kept all .NET + tooling + secrets coverage.

# ── IDE / editor ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/*.code-snippets
.history/
.idea/
*.vsix
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.userprefs
.vs/

# ── Build output ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
[Dd]ebug/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]elease/
[Rr]eleases/
x64/
x86/
bld/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
[Bb]uild[Ll]og.*
*.VisualState.xml
TestResult.xml
[Dd]ebugPS/
[Rr]eleasePS/
artifacts/

# ── NuGet / packages ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
**/[Pp]ackages/*
!**/[Pp]ackages/build/
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets
csx/

# ── Coverage / test artifacts ──────────────────────────────────────────
coverage/
coverage*.json
coverage*.xml
coverage*.info
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
*.dotCover
OpenCover/
TestResult.xml
*.lcov
BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/

# ── Misc / OS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_*
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log

# ── Local secrets — NEVER commit ───────────────────────────────────────
**/appsettings.Development.Local.json
**/*.Development.Local.json
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.secrets

# ── Agent worktrees (one per parallel agent) ───────────────────────────
.agents/worktree/
.claude/worktrees/

# ── Generated / vendored (we don't ship these yet) ────────────────────
**/[Mm]igrations/
# (Voluta itself has no migrations; rule kept for future Postgres checkpointer
#  should it ever use EF. Migrations belong to EF tooling.)